{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a000000000000000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 4160,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "# 概率空间、条件概率与 Bayes 法则\n\n**读图方式：** 上半部分是建模与条件信息；下半部分把“独立”的定义入口和边界命题分开。\n**关键区别：** 蓝色是定义入口，紫色是规则或定理，红色是不能越过的边界。\n**继续：** 随机计数进入 [[指示变量与随机计数.canvas|指示变量与随机计数]]；时间结构进入 [[随机过程基础.canvas|随机过程、平稳性与遍历性]]。\n\n*Definitions form the main route; counterexamples and non-implications remain separate, linkable boundaries.*"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[概率建模四步法|概率建模顺序]]\n*Probability modelling workflow*\n\n先定一次试验、基本结果和事件，再选公式并检查结果。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[离散概率空间]]\n*Discrete probability space*\n\n基本结果的概率非负且总和为一；事件概率按结果求和。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[古典概型等可能条件|计数公式的等可能条件]]\n*Equiprobable counting rule*\n\n“有利个数除以总数”只适用于有限且等可能的基本结果。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[互斥事件加法]]\n*Addition rule for events*\n\n互斥保证并概率可直接相加；一般情形必须扣除重复交集。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[补事件法]]\n*Complement rule*\n\n目标复杂而补事件简单时，用 $P(A)=1-P(A^c)$。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[条件概率]]\n*Conditional probability*\n\n已知 $B$ 后，把概率空间限制在 $B$ 并重新归一化。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[概率乘法法则]]\n*Multiplication rule*\n\n$P(A\\cap B)=P(A\\mid B)P(B)$；换条件方向也要换边际项。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[全概率公式]]\n*Law of total probability*\n\n沿完备互斥分区展开事件，再按各分区概率加权。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[Bayes法则|Bayes 法则]]\n*Bayes' rule*\n\n似然乘先验，再除以证据总概率，得到后验。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[灵敏度与后验概率|灵敏度不是阳性后患病率]]\n*Sensitivity is not the posterior*\n\n低基率下，假阳性会让阳性后的患病概率远低于灵敏度。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[事件独立]]\n*Independent events*\n\n两个事件的联合概率等于边际概率乘积。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[正概率互斥不独立]]\n*Positive-probability disjoint events are not independent*\n\n交集概率为零，而边际概率乘积为正。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[两两独立]]\n*Pairwise independence*\n\n任意两个成员都独立：事件检查二重交集，随机变量检查二元取值事件。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[相互独立]]\n*Mutual independence*\n\n事件或随机变量的每个有限子族都必须联合分解；不只检查每一对。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a00000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[两两独立不推出相互独立]]\n*Pairwise does not imply mutual independence*\n\n二阶分解不能补齐三重和更高阶分解。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[随机变量独立]]\n*Independence of random variables*\n\n一方取值生成的任意事件都与另一方的任意事件独立。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[随机变量独立的分布判据]]\n*Distribution criteria*\n\n联合 CDF 分解是通用判据；PMF 和密度分解是对应特例。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[条件独立]]\n*Conditional independence*\n\n给定同一信息后，每个有限子族的条件联合分布都分解；逐对检查不够。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[条件独立不等于边际独立]]\n*Conditional and marginal independence differ*\n\n加入或移除条件会改变所比较的分布。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[独立同分布|i.i.d.]]\n*Independent and identically distributed*\n\n共同分布与相互独立缺一不可。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3260,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[概率依赖与因果|概率依赖不是因果识别]]\n*Dependence is not causal identification*\n\n观察分布中的依赖或后验不能单独识别干预效果。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_space",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[概率空间|概率空间 (Ω, F, P)]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Probability space*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_sigma",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[σ-代数|σ-代数：合法事件族]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Sigma-algebra of events*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_axioms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[概率三公理|概率三公理]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Probability axioms*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_prior",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2580,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[先验分布|先验分布]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Prior distribution*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_like",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2580,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[似然函数|似然函数]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Likelihood function*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_post",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 2580,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[后验分布|后验分布]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Posterior distribution*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "psi_framework",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 2580,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[频率派与贝叶斯推断|推断框架与重复抽样评价]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Inference and repeated-sampling assessment*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    }
  ],
